                        // ===================================================================================
                        // STANCE II, LUNGE (`items.ron` Stance II rebinds the home verbs to these; see
                        // docs/planning/game/combat-stances.md, "Second pass"). The needle: it closes ground, and once it
                        // touches a foe it keeps touching it. Its hits come in drills, several pulses that hold the foe
                        // (`VolumeReaction::Autolink`, damage 1 and no launch, a GAP between Active windows is a new hit)
                        // and one that lets go, and a hit it confirms opens more (`Cancelable` with `condition: OnHit`).
                        // A carry is a side step friction does not eat (`SetSide` with `HoldVelocity`).
                        // ===================================================================================
                        // The opener: a stepping thrust. If it lands, a press (or the button still held) is the
                        // needle flurry; if it whiffed, a press is the long lunge.
